Japan's Space Chief described national plans to develop independent launch and exploration

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.160
capabilities amid growing international competition.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.560
The interview outlined ongoing projects and technology priorities.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.980
The focus includes building domestic infrastructure for future missions.

